2550/extras/50a5b1d59e1ed166738c7d932abe52c8.avif?t=1771669882\" width=1440 height=168 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Face mutated creatures, who act on their primal instincts to rip you apart. Fight through the swarm of these vicious beings that surround you, evade their attacks, and kill them before they kill you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2142550/extras/b98e13270212f1240942450cf0bd8a88.poster.avif?t=1771669882\" width=600 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2142550/extras/b98e13270212f1240942450cf0bd8a88.webm?t=1771669882\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2142550/extras/b98e13270212f1240942450cf0bd8a88.mp4?t=1771669882\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2142550/extras/0211f2d8e4d46e2e40fb070009931f4e.poster.avif?t=1771669882\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2142550/extras/0211f2d8e4d46e2e40fb070009931f4e.webm?t=1771669882\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2142550/extras/0211f2d8e4d46e2e40fb070009931f4e.mp4?t=1771669882\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2142550/extras/f0b9874ed283434a6958fa40f5f5994b.avif?t=1771669882\" width=1440 height=168 /></spa