playable Vikings through the Brotherhood System, completing quests and convincing them to join your tribe.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2142550/extras/31f294291b9da24f70c4c526b7b5449f.poster.avif?t=1771669882\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2142550/extras/31f294291b9da24f70c4c526b7b5449f.webm?t=1771669882\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2142550/extras/31f294291b9da24f70c4c526b7b5449f.mp4?t=1771669882\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2142550/extras/014b793e9007353442604ee9c29eee58.avif?t=1771669882\" width=1444 height=168 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Long after the destruction of humanity, a new era begins. The Earth as we know it had died and has been reborn into a new era, as V\u00e1renheim.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >For centuries, animals have been evolving into monster-like creatures, with the hunger for blood and primal revenge against the humans responsible for their ancestral mutations.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The rise of humanoids had developed into tribes. They have discovered old Nordic artefacts and revived the stories of Norse Mythology. But with the entire world against them, it has become necessary to augment themselves with metallic arms, legs, or anything that may help them survive and endure.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You play as the Vikings of Runik Dagaz, born into Mykrafjordur with a single purpose as the chosen. You are Vikings who are capable of reviving after death, and so you are the only ones who can protect your people from monsters and Vikings alike.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It is your duty to survive with your fellow Viking tribe from the darkness of Mykrafjordur.</p>","developers":["Runic Dices Entertainment"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"RPG","id":"3"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2142550/c214758974ed2d0024c7616c7c22ad9bce84b1f2/header.jpg?t=1771669882","is_free":false,"legal_notice":"Nanokings \u00a9 2022 Runic Dices Entertainment. Published under licence by Runic Dices Entertainment. Runic Dices Entertainment is a trademark or registered trademark of Runic Dices Entertainment. All other trademarks, copyrights and logos are property of their respective owners.","linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"name":"Nanokings","package_groups":[],"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS *:</strong> windows 7+<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Dual Core 2.4 GHz<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 2 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Nvidia 450 GTS / Radeon HD 5750 or better<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 10<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 1 GB available space<br></li><li><strong>Sound Card:</strong> DirectX compatible</li></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS *:</strong> windows 7+<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Dual Core 2.8 GHz<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 2 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Nvidia 460 GTS / Radeon HD 7800 or better<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 10<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 1 GB available space<br></li><li><strong>Sound Card:</strong> DirectX compatible</li></ul>"},"platforms"